1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,919
Ladies and gentlemen, friends, good morning.

2
00:00:04,519 --> 00:00:09,720
Fuzhou in midsummer is vibrant with light and lush with greenery,

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:15,859
and it's here in this beautiful open city with picturesque landscape

4
00:00:15,859 --> 00:00:18,539
that we gather at this hopeful time.

5
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:23,039
We are here to start the first epic advanced training program

6
00:00:23,039 --> 00:00:27,199
for leading professionals in clean energy sector.

7
00:00:27,199 --> 00:00:35,579
On behalf of China Energy Investment Corporation, I would like to extend a warm welcome to all

8
00:00:35,579 --> 00:00:40,100
the participants and guests from the economic community.

9
00:00:40,179 --> 00:00:43,960
Thank you for traveling such a long way to join us.

10
00:00:45,369 --> 00:00:53,450
This training program is co-hosted by China Energy Investment Corporation and North China

11
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:54,729
Electric Power Corporation.

12
00:00:54,729 --> 00:01:03,740
We have received careful guidance and strong support from the APEC Secretariat, Ministry

13
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:09,400
of Foreign Affairs of China, and the National Energy Administration of China.

14
00:01:09,739 --> 00:01:17,599
We also appreciate the full support and careful organization from the Fujian Provincial Energy

15
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:25,379
Administration and other relevant departments, Longyuan Power and the School of Continuing

16
00:01:25,379 --> 00:01:29,000
Education of North China Electric Power University.

17
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:36,579
I would like to express my sincere gratitude and respect to all leaders and colleagues

18
00:01:37,159 --> 00:01:40,719
who have helped organize and support this event.

19
00:01:40,719 --> 00:01:48,780
The year 2026 is a milestone for Asia-Pacific cooperation.

20
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:53,719
It's also the third time that China serves as APEC chair.

21
00:01:54,299 --> 00:02:02,239
This year's APEC thing is building an Asia-Pacific community to prosper together.

22
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:12,400
The energy theme is fort and innovative as a synergistic Asia-Pacific energy community for all.

23
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:25,659
These themes set a clear direction and build common understanding for energy transition, green cooperation and mutual benefit in the region.

24
00:02:25,659 --> 00:02:43,159
China Energy Investment Corporation and North China Electric Power University are jointly working to establish the Asia-Pacific Clean Energy Training Institute.

25
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:55,939
The Institute aims to serve epic economies through talent development, policy exchange, technology sharing, and industry collaboration.

26
00:02:55,939 --> 00:03:04,250
This training program is a practical step by China to advance Asia-Pacific energy cooperation

27
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:08,069
and deepen regional green development.

28
00:03:08,530 --> 00:03:13,229
It has important demonstrative and pioneering value.

29
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:16,740
Here participate other friends.

30
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:24,280
The theme of this training program is innovative practices in clean energy development.

31
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:34,139
It draws on the industrial trends of China energy and the academic expertise of North

32
00:03:34,139 --> 00:03:36,120
China Electric Power University.

33
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:45,300
The program focuses on new power systems, new energy technology updates, and green business

34
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:45,979
integration.

35
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:51,180
We have designed high-quality professional courses.

36
00:03:51,180 --> 00:04:00,639
We have also included cultural experiences like Chinese Intangible Cultural Heritage and tea culture.

37
00:04:00,979 --> 00:04:09,789
We hope that through mutual learning, you will improve professional skills and gain new ideas.

38
00:04:10,229 --> 00:04:19,389
We also hope that through cultural exchanges, you will build friendships and find common ground.

39
00:04:19,389 --> 00:04:27,709
We look forward to sharing practical experiences and governance wisdom on energy transition.

40
00:04:28,300 --> 00:04:36,040
Together, we will inject new momentum into Asia-Pacific green and low-carbon cooperation.

41
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:48,439
Ladies and gentlemen, the successful opening of this training program is a key step in building the Asia-Pacific Clean Energy Training Institute.

42
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:57,800
We know that a cooperative outcome can only thrive with sustained cooperation, broad participation

43
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,800
and joint commitment.

44
00:05:01,250 --> 00:05:04,970
I would like to make a sincere call to all of you.

45
00:05:05,110 --> 00:05:12,670
I hope you will not just be participants in this program, but also promoters and advocates

46
00:05:13,290 --> 00:05:15,629
for the Institute's future development.

47
00:05:15,629 --> 00:05:22,060
Please take what you have learned and experienced back to your economies.

48
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:28,300
Let all of your colleagues know about this platform and join it.

49
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:34,399
Let us work together to turn the Asia Pacific Clean Energy Training Institute

50
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:41,430
from a Chinese-led initiative into a long-term cooperation mechanism

51
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:46,550
that all parties in the region nurture and benefit from.

52
00:05:51,290 --> 00:05:57,779
Let us deliver lasting results that stand the test of time for epic energy cooperation.

53
00:05:58,439 --> 00:06:04,120
Finally, I wish this epic advanced training program a great success.

54
00:06:04,540 --> 00:06:09,959
I wish all participants a rewarding and enjoyable stay in Fujian.

55
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:16,160
May you learn well, gain insights, have a smooth journey, and enjoy good health.

56
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,160
Thank you all.

